    "text": "Source:CCTV.com 15-07-25 05:27 Updated BJT Font size: A+ A- China on Tuesday announced the successful launch of the Tianzhou-9 cargo craft, which is delivering supplies for its orbiting Tiangong space station. Among the 6.5 tonnes of supplies are two upgraded spacewalk suits, designed with enhanced performance and extended service life -- improvements based on data from previous Chinese extravehicular missions.",
